:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F16 ACTION='MENU MAJOR'.F16=Major menu
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=CMDJOBD HELP=HLPCMDJOBD KEYL=MENUKEYS ENTER='RETURN 1' PANELID=PANELID.Job Description Commands
:MENU DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES OPTIONS=OPTION.Select one of the following:
:MENUGRP.Commands
:MENUI OPTION=1 ACTION='CMD ?CHGJOBD' HELP=CHGJOBD.Change Job Description  CHGJOBD
:MENUI OPTION=2 ACTION='CMD ?CRTJOBD' HELP=CRTJOBD.Create Job Description  CRTJOBD
:MENUI OPTION=3 ACTION='CMD ?DLTJOBD' HELP=DLTJOBD.Delete Job Description  DLTJOBD
:MENUI OPTION=4 ACTION='CMD ?DSPJOBD' HELP=DSPJOBD.Display Job Description  DSPJOBD
:MENUI OPTION=5 ACTION='CMD ?PRTJOBDAUT' HELP=PRTJOBDAUT.Print Job Description Auth  PRTJOBDAUT
:MENUI OPTION=6 ACTION='CMD ?WRKJOBD' HELP=WRKJOBD.Work with Job Descriptions  WRKJOBD
:EMENUGRP.
:EMENU.
:CMDLINE SIZE=LONG.Selection or command
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPCMDJOBD.Job Description Commands - Help
:P.Job Description Commands: every command whose name carries JOBD after its verb, in name order, with the command name at the right of its row. The option numbers follow the full command set of the systems this one is compatible with, so a blank row is a command this release does not provide.
:P.Type an option number and press Enter to prompt the command, or type a command on the command line. F12 returns to the previous menu, F3 to the menu where you started and F16 to the major command groups.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=HLPKEYS.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F1=Help
:PD.Shows help for the item the cursor is on; on the title, help for the whole menu.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Leaves the menu and the menus it was reached from.
:PT.F4=Prompt
:PD.Prompts the command on the command line, or the command of the option typed.
:PT.F9=Retrieve
:PD.Puts the last command run back on the command line; press it again for the one before.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous menu.
:PT.F16=Major menu
:PD.Shows that menu.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
